{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03418",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.24,
      "end_seconds": 2.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 3.48,
      "end_seconds": 7.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.3,
      "end_seconds": 17.17,
      "duration_seconds": 7.87,
      "text": "Doctor, it's a splash of cleaning fluid in my eye. It's getting on my nerves now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.77,
      "end_seconds": 20.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.62,
      "end_seconds": 26.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Since last Tuesday, that's when it began"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.85,
      "end_seconds": 31.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Rate it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.43,
      "end_seconds": 42.32,
      "duration_seconds": 9.89,
      "text": "Right, it feels moderate to me. Oh, and blurred vision. That's been about the same, two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.03,
      "end_seconds": 58.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.8,
      "end_seconds": 71.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.92,
      "end_seconds": 96.01,
      "duration_seconds": 10.09,
      "text": "okay: respiratory rate 14, temperature 36.4, BP is 113 over 73, oxygen saturation is 97 percent, heart rate 73."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.97,
      "end_seconds": 98.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.46,
      "end_seconds": 105.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "They help me see the whole picture, more shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.5,
      "end_seconds": 110.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.66,
      "end_seconds": 122.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.65,
      "end_seconds": 127.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.65,
      "end_seconds": 148.13,
      "duration_seconds": 8.48,
      "text": "The eye is very red with a cloudy cornea and the pH of the tears is very high."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.99,
      "end_seconds": 150.95,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.39,
      "end_seconds": 158.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "That's the examination finished."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.35,
      "end_seconds": 177.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Did you get head injury or both eyes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.06,
      "end_seconds": 182.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "I haven't had head injury or both eyes, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.37,
      "end_seconds": 186.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.08,
      "end_seconds": 189.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "Skin's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.4,
      "end_seconds": 192.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.01,
      "end_seconds": 203.27,
      "duration_seconds": 9.26,
      "text": "I take iron tablets, once a day. Work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.54,
      "end_seconds": 207.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.07,
      "end_seconds": 210.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Yes, cat fur. I get sneezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.55,
      "end_seconds": 214.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.38,
      "end_seconds": 221.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Actually, I've had low haemoglobin for five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.99,
      "end_seconds": 227.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "Okay, I can see low haemoglobin in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.98,
      "end_seconds": 237.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.12,
      "end_seconds": 251.08,
      "duration_seconds": 11.96,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. Not much, I mostly stay in these days. I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.75,
      "end_seconds": 265.54,
      "duration_seconds": 13.79,
      "text": "taking everything into account, it fits best with an alkali chemical burn to the eye. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.28,
      "end_seconds": 269.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.66,
      "end_seconds": 299.81,
      "duration_seconds": 28.15,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with an alkali chemical burn to the eye do well once it's treated properly. I'll request an urgent pH check, it'll help with chemical burn. Let's get an urgent eye assessment, for chemical eye injury. I'd like you to take sterile saline irrigation, 2 litres, continuous, until pH neutral. That's for chemical eye burn."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.92,
      "end_seconds": 306.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.13,
      "end_seconds": 326.54,
      "duration_seconds": 18.41,
      "text": "I am washing the eye now, keep it open and do not stop. I'd like you to see the eye emergency service as well, and I'll write the referral. Please don't wait if the symptoms get worse. That's when to be seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.5,
      "end_seconds": 333.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "okay, makes sense"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.07,
      "end_seconds": 338.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Come back straight away. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.52,
      "end_seconds": 342.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "thank you, that's helpful"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.3,
      "end_seconds": 345.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}